      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SCOOTIN' SCOOBY (4) missed the hat-trick last start when second and beaten 1.5 lengths (25.12) last time at this track. Has never been out of the money in three starts this distance. Has performed well from this box with a win and four minor placings to his name from six starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. SWIFT BREE (1) goes very well this course and distance starting 13 times for five wins and two minors. Below best last time at Dubbo (23.20) in a Grade 4, finishing a 7 length fourth. Looks one of the chances. MOTOR CITY SONNY (7) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from five starts. Below best last time at Wagga (30.40) in a NG, finishing a 14 length seventh. Looks a key chance on best figures. ZIPPING LYNDY (5) was unplaced here last start but gets her chance to atone.",
